        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkethĩwa mũthenya ũsu, yĩla Ngoki ĩkamyũkĩa nthĩ ya Isilaeli, easya ũu Mwĩaĩi Yeova, ũthilĩku wakwa ũkambata manyiũũnĩ makwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
