          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ kĩwĩunĩ kyakwa na mwakinĩ wa ũthilĩku wakwa nĩnĩneenete, Vate ndĩi mũthenya ũsu kũkethĩwa kĩthingithyo kĩnene nthĩ ya Isilaeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.19",
